    "q-167613": {
      "dom_id": "question-167613",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "Complete the following facts about the function $y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        The domain of the function is $x\\in ($\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-2}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$).$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                                \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        The range of the function is $[$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-3}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-4}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$].$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                                \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        The period of the function is\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-5}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        .",
      "worked_solution": "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$ \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14266225/assets/cebd0527c2b8b3bcdf2948da0771103f17412ff058d74b96db1287a7046ba3bc.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- The domain of the function is $(-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\n- The minimum value is $-1,$ and the maximum value is $1.$ Therefore, the range is $[-1,1].$\n\n- The period of $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$ is $2\\pi .$",
